---
LaTeX highlighter: highlight.js
---

Code blocks coloured by highlight.js in Pygments' default colours, set in
fvextra's Verbatim: no minted, no shell escape.

```python
@decorator
def foo(x, y=1):
    """A docstring."""
    if x is not None and y in [1, 2]:
        return self.x + 2 * len("a\n%s" % y)  # a comment

	print(f"v={x!r}", True)
class Bar(object): pass
```

```js
// A comment
const re = /ab+c/g, s = `t ${x + 1}`;
function foo(a, b = 2) { return typeof a === 'string' ? this.x : new Map(); }
/* A comment
   over two lines */ obj.prop?.call({ k: [1, 2] });
```

```json
{"key": "v\\n", "n": 1.5, "b": true, "z": null}
```

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<div class="x" id='y'>Text &amp; <b>bold</b><!-- c --></div>
```

```css
.cls #id a:hover { color: #fff; margin: 0 1px !important; }
```

```bash
#!/bin/bash
for f in *.md; do echo "$f ${HOME}" | grep -v 'x' > /dev/null; done
```

```latex
\documentclass{article} % a comment
\begin{document} $x^2_1$ \textbf{b} \end{document}
```

```markdown
# A heading
* An item, *emphasis*, **strong**, `code` and [a link](http://example.com)
```

```yaml
key: value # a comment
quoted: "a string"
flag: true
```

```c
#include <stdio.h>
int main(void) { char *s = "x\n"; return printf("%d", 1) > 0; }
```

A language highlight.js does not know, and none, print as written:

```dataview
TABLE file.name FROM "x"
```

